Greetings All,

	I perform DU installs for our customers. For DU 3.2XX we used the
following guidelines recommended by a DEC DU consultant:


	file system	size					fs type
	-----------	----					-------
	root		100 MB					advfs
	swap		phys mem * 2.5
	var		phys mem + 30 MB			advfs
	usr		remainder of disk (at least 500 MB)	advfs


	Does anyone have recommneded guidelines for DU 4.0? The only
information I've seen so far is that swap should be at least 128 MB.


