 -a large domain is not easy to manage
when you make a clone (for backup)
if there is activities on the file system then your domain grow because
the clone goes into your domain. (you can't choise)

If the domain crash, (some times this can appen because of BUGS)
you must restore large data.

If you can put an application in one domain, the other in an other etc ...
I think that 's good to separate, then if one domain crash, only the
application on this domain must be restored.

