Subject: [SUMMARY] Crack
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96076333621547

Dear Gurus,

My problem installing Crack while compiling crack-fcrypt.c is solved, 
thanks to:

mir@currif2.u-strasbg.fr
Todd Acheson <acheson@oak.cats.ohiou.edu>
Mike Iglesias <iglesias@draco.acs.uci.edu>
Tom Webster <webster@i5142311.mdc.com>

The solution:

1) don't use fcrypt as implemented in Crack, rather use "UFC" (Ultra Fast 
Crypt)
2) I got the ufc-crypt files from
   ftp://ftp.funet.fi/pub/crypt/cryptography/symmetric/des/ufc-crypt/
   and installed them in Crack/ufc-crypt
3) I applied the patches that "mir" and Mike kindly sent
4) et voila...

Thanks again,

Jean-Loup

