My original posting:

>I'm running DU3.2C on an Alpha1000.  I am trying to send to remote
>printers defined in the printcap file.  Because I could not reach one
>of the printers I followed the instructions in the DEC/OSF Sys Admin
>manual to kill and restart the printer:
>
>rm -f  /dev/printer /var/spool/lpd.lock
>/usr/lbin/lpd -l
>
>Now, I can't print to any of the remote printers...

The solution:

Kill -9 pid of parent lpd, followed by an "lpc restart all"
My problem was that I had not killed the parent lpd.

